cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CAS: Community Attribute Service"
abstract: >-
  CAS provides harmonized, quality-controlled zonal attribute extraction
  (elevation, soil, land cover, hydrology, vegetation, geology, climate)
  from more than 200 upstream geospatial data providers through a single
  CLI, HTTP API, and Python SDK, without storing any data itself.
